## Handoff and follow-up
Give the operations shift a short handoff containing the incident identifier, affected batches, remaining restrictions, owner, and next verification time. Do not paste contact details into the handoff; refer to the restricted ledger. The next shift checks that a delayed receipt did not accidentally reactivate the superseded batch. At the next business review, compare the partner's delivered counts with the approved release counts and investigate any difference. Delivery counts can confirm handling consistency but cannot prove that every individual message was read, understood, or acted upon."}

